{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod","id":1420445,"title":"Why do Sabbat support the Book of Nod?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-27T06:19:12-07:00","id":1420445,"title":"Why do Sabbat support the Book of Nod?","content":"Seriously. In game, all the scholars say it was written by Elders and Antediluvians. The Sabbat is supposed to be fighting those. Why would you believe anything they wrote? Besides the usual hypocrisy thing we find among the Sects.<br /> <br /> I'd like to see this being an avenue for why the Church of Caine broke off in V5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T06:27:16-07:00","id":1420450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PJ123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod#post1420445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seriously. In game, all the scholars say it was written by Elders and Antediluvians. The Sabbat is supposed to be fighting those. Why would you believe anything they wrote? Besides the usual hypocrisy thing we find among the Sects.<br /> <br /> I'd like to see this being an avenue for why the Church of Caine broke off in V5.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. The Sabbat believe it's true. The Sabbat believe the Camarilla denies the Book of Nod because it's true. They also very much believe in the Antediluvians, they just believe they need to be destroyed. Until V5, possessing the Book of Nod was a punishable offense in the Camarilla and they deied the existence of Gehenna and the Antediluvians. The Sabbat got a lot of recruits by being the people who DID believe in it.<br /> <br /> 2. The modern Book of Nod is less like the Bible and more like Grimms Fairy Tales or Arabian Nights. Its a collection of vampiric folklore as collected by Aristotle de Laurent. Some of it written down, some of it not. There's no telling if there's ever been an original book before the Ericyne Fragments but its Kindred folklore that most clans have a variant of. If you want to know who Aristotle de Laurent is, basically assume he's the Bulfinch of the Vampire World. Before him, there was no single Book of Nod to read.<br /> <br /> 3. The Church of Caine isn't a Sabbat breakway sect. It's the original Cainite Hersey from the Dark Ages being revived in the Modern Era. It is the dire enemy of the Sabbat who want to see every member of it exterminated. The Sabbat murdered its members and stole its Noddist lore during the Dark Ages. They had their own Noddist books prior to Artistotle and the Sabbat looted them as well as their rituals. Either some surviving members finally got out of torpor or some guys found their old stuff and revived the religion or both. There's a few Sabbat defectors but they view the Sabbat as their version of ISIS.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T09:39:13-07:00","id":1420493,"title":"","content":"Because the Sabbat is just another part of the Jyhad no matter how much they are in denial? The sabbat are no more let in on the &quot;real truth&quot; than your average camarillian denying surving Antedeluvians or cycles of Gehenna. They just think they are. No one is let in on the &quot;Real truth&quot; everyone is being manipulated. Its all lies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T10:20:01-07:00","id":1420503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PJ123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod#post1420445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seriously. In game, all the scholars say it was written by Elders and Antediluvians. The Sabbat is supposed to be fighting those. Why would you believe anything they wrote? Besides the usual hypocrisy thing we find among the Sects.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;hypocrisy&quot; gotta be the most overused word in this god forsaken forum<br /> <br /> the sabbat do not accept the book of nod, or at least they wouldn't if they had the full version (which they don't, which is why they have scholars and templars tasked with searching for noddist lore)<br /> <br /> in Montreal (Revised), scholars had brought a fragment of the original book of nod,<br /> the scholars hid it due to the controversial content of the fragment,<br /> later, when the fragment was revealed to the sabbat, half the city went to chaos","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T15:26:14-07:00","id":1420561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420503#post1420503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;hypocrisy&quot; gotta be the most overused word in this god forsaken forum<br /> <br /> the sabbat do not accept the book of nod, or at least they wouldn't if they had the full version (which they don't, which is why they have scholars and templars tasked with searching for noddist lore)<br /> <br /> in Montreal (Revised), scholars had brought a fragment of the original book of nod,<br /> the scholars hid it due to the controversial content of the fragment,<br /> later, when the fragment was revealed to the sabbat, half the city went to chaos</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh, now i'm curious, where do i find this fragment's plotline and contents?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T15:28:53-07:00","id":1420562,"title":"","content":"The Book of Nod as published by Aristotle de Laurent has Caine say that diablerie is the most horrific evil thing that any Kindred can do and will bring his ultimate wrath.<br /> <br /> So, it's hilarious to assume the Sabbat (Especially the Path of Caine ones) going, &quot;Well, he's not speaking literally, obviously. It's more that diablerie is a horrific evil that will be punished when OTHER vampires than us do it.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T15:31:28-07:00","id":1420564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420561#post1420561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Oh, now i'm curious, where do i find this fragment's plotline and contents?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nights of Prophecy, I think","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T15:44:40-07:00","id":1420569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420564#post1420564\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nights of Prophecy, I think</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah, the terrible, terrible book. Should have known. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Going to look for that anyway. Thanks.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420450#post1420450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1. The Sabbat believe it's true. The Sabbat believe the Camarilla denies the Book of Nod because it's true. They also very much believe in the Antediluvians, they just believe they need to be destroyed. Until V5, possessing the Book of Nod was a punishable offense in the Camarilla and they deied the existence of Gehenna and the Antediluvians. The Sabbat got a lot of recruits by being the people who DID believe in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed, though in my games it's kind of a &quot;smoking pot&quot; offense, severity highly dependent on local law, authorities, who actually caught sight of you doing it and what social strata you are part of. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420450#post1420450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. The modern Book of Nod is less like the Bible and more like Grimms Fairy Tales or Arabian Nights. Its a collection of vampiric folklore as collected by Aristotle de Laurent. Some of it written down, some of it not. There's no telling if there's ever been an original book before the Ericyne Fragments but its Kindred folklore that most clans have a variant of. If you want to know who Aristotle de Laurent is, basically assume he's the Bulfinch of the Vampire World. Before him, there was no single Book of Nod to read.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do tend to consider there have been many other contemporarily less known works by the same name from previous authors, much like Sun Tzu's text is far from the only one to be published under the title &quot;Art of War&quot; in the western world.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420450#post1420450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. The Church of Caine isn't a Sabbat breakway sect. It's the original Cainite Hersey from the Dark Ages being revived in the Modern Era. It is the dire enemy of the Sabbat who want to see every member of it exterminated. The Sabbat murdered its members and stole its Noddist lore during the Dark Ages. They had their own Noddist books prior to Artistotle and the Sabbat looted them as well as their rituals. Either some surviving members finally got out of torpor or some guys found their old stuff and revived the religion or both. There's a few Sabbat defectors but they view the Sabbat as their version of ISIS.</div> </div> </div> </div>- Cainite <a href=\"https://images.heb.com/is/image/HEBGrocery/000112558\" target=\"_blank\">Hershey</a>?!<br /> - Cainite Jersey? State, island, city, garment, what?!<br /> <br /> We require clarifications!!!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 12-24-2024, 11:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T17:07:06-07:00","id":1420587,"title":"","content":"Cainite Hershey certainly justifies diablerie especially during an esbat on Halloween. It says so in this lost stone fragment over here....oops, dropped it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24582-ruthven","name":"Ruthven","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T17:17:22-07:00","id":1420591,"title":"","content":"But yes, the Cainite Heresy is a Byzantine cult of vampire worshipers that are based on an older edition of the Book of Nod that fell into the hands of mortals.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/51zNowNHHBL.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> The Lasombra eventually destroyed the organization but then stole everything and passed it onto the Sabbat. It seems to be the basis for the Path of Cathari and a lot of the Sabbat's ritae.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T20:32:52-07:00","id":1420605,"title":"","content":"The Book of Nod as published by Anatole is what we've seen of it. It's not intended to be a complete work by any means and is certainly subject to mistranslation, either in error or intentionally. For the most part, the Sabbat focuses more on The Chronicle of Caine and The Chronicle of Secrets than The Chronicle of Shadows which is where most of the supposed laws are written. Many will argue that Chronicles of Shadows was written by the very elders and antediluvians that they fight against, or at the very least that the rules laid down in that chapter were tainted in translation by their doing. <br /> <br /> For comparison, we know that whether by intention or by accident rules and stories from the bible you find at bookstores, churches, motels, or wherever you get you bible, aren't the same as they were 100, 500, or 1,000 years ago. Hell, you can go to Barnes and Noble and find probably a dozen different translations. Now imagine that but the writings were hidden from the public eye, going back 10 millennia. Few Sabbat look at the Book of Nod as a literal translation of the voice of Caine just like few Christians look at the Bible and say &quot;everything in this happened exactly this way and this is the exact word for word word of God&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T05:00:43-07:00","id":1420655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420591#post1420591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But yes, the Cainite Heresy is a Byzantine cult of vampire worshipers that are based on an older edition of the Book of Nod that fell into the hands of mortals.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/51zNowNHHBL.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> The Lasombra eventually destroyed the organization but then stole everything and passed it onto the Sabbat. It seems to be the basis for the Path of Cathari and a lot of the Sabbat's ritae.</div> </div> </div> </div>Destroyed or took over/subsumed? The fact a lot of its lore seems to have influenced the philosophical/spiritual side of the Sabbat would appear to imply much more of the later than the former. But then i'll be the first to admit my familiarity with DA lore and how it connects or not to VtM's own can be spotty at times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T05:05:50-07:00","id":1420657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420655#post1420655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Destroyed or took over/subsumed? The fact a lot of its lore seems to have influenced the philosophical/spiritual side of the Sabbat would appear to imply much more of the later than the former. But then i'll be the first to admit my familiarity with DA lore and how it connects or not to VtM's own can be spotty at times.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cults of the Blood Gods state they enacted genocide on the Cainite Heresy's believers and that the Modern Day version hunt down and kill the Lasombra whenever they can.<br /> <br /> I admit, I know very little about this element of the story and never actually read the above Cainite Heresy supplement.<br /> <br /> I don't know why the Lasombra seemed to hate them so much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T05:16:29-07:00","id":1420658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420657#post1420657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Cults of the Blood Gods state they enacted genocide on the Cainite Heresy's believers and that the Modern Day version hunt down and kill the Lasombra whenever they can.<br /> <br /> I admit, I know very little about this element of the story and never actually read the above Cainite Heresy supplement.<br /> <br /> I don't know why the Lasombra seemed to hate them so much.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Honestly, from what little i read on DA i always had pretty much the opposite impression. Looks like i'll have to check both Heresy and Blood Gods to try to make some sense of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T05:54:47-07:00","id":1420665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420657#post1420657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know why the Lasombra seemed to hate them so much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lasombra on path of night are big on christianity, and no other gods before me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T05:55:44-07:00","id":1420667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420665#post1420665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lasombra on path of night are big on christianity, and no other gods before me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, so they must hate the HERETICAL Christiabs more than the actual pagans.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T06:16:58-07:00","id":1420669,"title":"","content":"So from what I'm reading here, it could stand to reason that there will be a split in the Sabbat. Those that think the Book of Nod is gospel, and those that think it's propaganda written by the very vampires they're fighting against.<br /> <br /> I like the idea that Sabbat calling the book BS might start to take Caine as a metaphor for the perfect vampire, not necessarily an actual being.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T06:20:44-07:00","id":1420670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420667#post1420667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, so they must hate the HERETICAL Christiabs more than the actual pagans.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not really but you should probably read the book before pointlessly speculating on things","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T06:23:24-07:00","id":1420672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420670#post1420670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not really but you should probably read the book before pointlessly speculating on things</div> </div> </div> </div>Well I did read Cults of the Blood Gods and it says the Lasombra hated them as well as exterminated them.<br /> <br /> And the Church of Caine is composed of Christians.<br /> <br /> So, yes, they acted that way even more than to the actual pagan cults of Kindred.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T06:37:32-07:00","id":1420675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420672#post1420672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well I did read Cults of the Blood Gods and it says the Lasombra hated them as well as exterminated them.<br /> <br /> And the Church of Caine is composed of Christians.<br /> <br /> So, yes, they acted that way even more than to the actual pagan cults of Kindred.</div> </div> </div> </div>I ment the canite heresy supplement","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T17:14:06-07:00","id":1420731,"title":"","content":"The Heresy had a lot of Lasombra in its membership, but the more devout traditional Catholic Lasombra saw it as a gnostic blasphemy as well as a rival for influence within the Church.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T18:51:33-07:00","id":1420740,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reasor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420731#post1420731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Heresy had a lot of Lasombra in its membership, but the more devout traditional Catholic Lasombra saw it as a gnostic blasphemy as well as a rival for influence within the Church.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So one might say the Lasombra catholic status quo suported its destruction - while survivors of the movement would join the young rebelious childer that would join the Anarch Revolt, topple the clan leadership and help form the Sabbat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T19:44:20-07:00","id":1420749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420740#post1420740\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So one might say the Lasombra catholic status quo suported its destruction - while survivors of the movement would join the young rebelious childer that would join the Anarch Revolt, topple the clan leadership and help form the Sabbat.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it was the Catholic Lasombra who joined the Sabbat. As stated, the Sabbat were ruthless and brutal to the Cainite Heresy.<br /> <br /> But again, I found that interesting in Cults of the Blood Gods that the Church of Caine was so anti-Sabbat.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T20:50:54-07:00","id":1420760,"title":"","content":"Theres actually a little section in caines chosen that talks about influence of the cainite heresy in the sabbat as well as some of its members surviving in the sect as well. So...extermination is about accurate as saying the tremere killed all salubri.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T05:23:01-07:00","id":1420804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperSabbatST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1420760#post1420760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Theres actually a little section in caines chosen that talks about influence of the cainite heresy in the sabbat as well as some of its members surviving in the sect as well. So...extermination is about accurate as saying the tremere killed all salubri.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Possibly even less so, as the Lasombra might have had as much to do with its preservation through the Sabbat's spiritual traditions as its supposed extermination. Beside the fact the Cappadocians and Toreador might have been just as involved or nearly so with the heresy/movement/proto-sect, i guess.<br /> <br /> Not to mention putting the blame for the Heresy's fall in any one's clan when the organization's own nature made it that \u00fcber blasphemous target to pretty much any medieval witch hunter with something like religious motives. Between that and the &quot;we're doomed!!!&quot; mania induced by their own prophecies it can honestly make one question how much of a hand the Giovanni really had in bringing down the Cappadocians in the first place.<br /> <br /> (All of that said, some individual kindred in and out of the Giovanni, <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Genevra\" target=\"_blank\">Genevra</a> being a most notable case, did have quite the story of using the Inquisition and other groups similarly tied to the Church as cat's paws. Those would definitely have a major role in the Caps fall and the plundering of their noddist/mystic legacy as a whole. Indeed, based on these details, her personal ambition, lack of clan loyalty and connections to the Sabbat i would use Genevra as a substitute for <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Ambrogino_Giovanni\" target=\"_blank\">Ambrogino </a>in my &quot;playthrough&quot; of Giovanni Chronicles. What among other things made her cameo and destruction at the final chapter of the series that much more relevant and climatic)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 10-29-2020, 08:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T13:58:55-08:00","id":1421333,"title":"","content":"I think this is an easy thing to answer. The Book of Nod is essentially about Caine. The Sabbat believes Caine disguised himself as the Ravnos methusaleh Vestgeir, and Vestgeir was instrumental in saving the early sect from destruction. Thus most Sabbat members believe Caine himself created their sect. And since the Book of Nod is about Caine, it makes sense for the Sabbat to honor their &quot;founder&quot; by learning more about him.<br /> <br /> They believe Caine wants them to be free, and that the antedeluvians' rebellion against him was because they wanted to enslave their childer and Caine wouldn't let them. Hence why it's OK to destroy antedeluvians, but why they revere Caine.<br /> <br /> The story of Vestgeir, Caine, and the Sabbat's belief Caine created the Sabbat was in the first ST's Guide to the Sabbat. But like a lot of early lore, it's not necessarily repeated in future materials.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","user":"Black Fox","date":". 11-01-2020, 05:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T15:56:17-08:00","id":1421355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1421333#post1421333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They believe Caine wants them to be free, and that the antedeluvians' rebellion against him was because they wanted to enslave their childer and Caine wouldn't let them. Hence why it's OK to destroy antedeluvians, but why they revere Caine.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this gets at the heart of answering the question in the thread title. The Tzimisce and Lasombra Anarchs either sincerely believed that their oppression went all the way to the top of their respective clans, or attacked their founders in a bid for enough power to overwhelm their more closely related elders; either way, a precedent was set and afterward they were all in on opposing the Antedeluvians - now out of necessity, because surely some other clan's ancients would want to make an example out of the upstarts.<br /> <br /> The closest extant thing to a written source on the Antedeluvians, the scattered fragments that would eventually be compiled as the Book of Nod, depict the Antedeluvians as crashing disappointments to Caine, making the rift between the Third Generation and Caine the line where the chain of oppressors and manipulators could plausibly end. This makes Caine an ultimate &quot;good daddy&quot; figure for the Anarch Revolt and the Sabbat which sprang from it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T16:52:40-08:00","id":1421359,"title":"","content":"I suppose that makes sense if the majority of Sabbat are like mortals, cherry picking what they want from their religious text and ignoring the rest (like treating those who serve well, respecting their elders, not committing Amaranth... Among other things throughout the book). I can see, and even get, reverence for Caine. What I don't get is the whole group of them getting behind a book that was reportedly written by Antediluvians and/or Methuselahs.<br /> <br /> V5 has the Church of Caine, which takes issue with the Sabbat. This makes sense, as the Sabbat essentially ignores most of what the Book of Nod says (and exalts themselves as predators, not as some kind of divinely gifted beings). I'd like to imagine that some charismatic pack priests started to convince Sabbat that following in the steps of the Dark Father is to be commended, but doing so based on the Book of Nod is a trap. This would, of course, cause a crisis of faith. Some would reconcile their faith with their Sect, others will jump ship to the Church of Caine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-13T12:37:18-08:00","id":1545808,"title":"","content":"Well, the &quot;Book of Nod&quot; is a really bad term I think. For there never was a Book. Even Aristotle de Laurent's book is a collection of fragments accompanied by an essay. The same could be said of the Fragments of Erciyes. But, just like the bible is not a single bible, there are hundred of versions, depending specially of the Christian denomination. Some use a form of 'book of x' instead of another. Others remove entire 'book of x' from their bible and consider apocryphal. <br /> <br /> Camarilla should love the book of nod. It is all about obeying elders, obeying traditions, you being cursed and miserable and having to make your part in society, leaving humans alone, respecting the blood bond, adhering to Clan structure, and never diablerising. But... I guess they got scared between the 15th and 19th centuries. The Treaty of Thorns calls to Caine after all.<br /> <br /> So, for sure we would have many versions.<br /> The Church of Caine has the book of shining blood too, for their Book of Nod would be unique and gnostic. Many groups would have their own versions. I'm sure the Order of Bitter Ashes (or the society behind it) would have a version of their own too. The Inconnu might have their own, Tal'Mahe'Ra too. <br /> <br /> And yes, Sabbat would 100% have their own Book of Nod. It really baffles me that they never made any material for it. I mean, we have snipets of original passages it in books of the Black Hand (2nd to 4th edition if I'm not mistaken), quotes of 'a' book of nod that you won't find in De Laurent's version.<br /> <br /> I love Revelations of the Dark Mother. And Fragments of Erciyes is way better than Book of Nod (if came way later too, when the setting was more matured, so it's fair).<br /> But I think my favorite 'Book of X' that we have is the Testament of Longinus from Requiem. Which is part of my Vampire Masquerade setting XD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Strange... When coincidence seems too convenient, I prefer to call it fate.</i><br /> <br /> <b><sup>-Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain</sup> </b>d=","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25534-banu_saulot","name":"Banu_Saulot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25534_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T13:51:02-08:00","id":1545880,"title":"","content":"Hypocrisy is a norm for the Kindred and in this case the Sabbat could be seen as a symbol of rebellion against a predestinated fate, plus people no matter how intelligent or seemingly wise will believe in strange things and overlook things that may shred their beliefs,<br /> <br /> As pointed out above none of the Kindred truly know what is the truth and that would include folks like Montano and the others including the 3rd generation as they maybe been told a series of half truths and lies by there sires and &quot;Kaine&quot; himself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-15T11:14:50-08:00","id":1545955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1545880#post1545880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hypocrisy is a norm for the Kindred and in this case the Sabbat could be seen as a symbol of rebellion against a predestinated fate, plus people no matter how intelligent or seemingly wise will believe in strange things and overlook things that may shred their beliefs,<br /> <br /> As pointed out above none of the Kindred truly know what is the truth and that would include folks like Montano and the others including the 3rd generation as they maybe been told a series of half truths and lies by there sires and &quot;Kaine&quot; himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>While the Camarilla in my view is based on the conciliation of hypocrisis, the attempt to mend the contradictions, the Sabbat tries to end all contradictions through extremety. So if it is hypocritical that vampires try to be humane while killing humans to keep on living, than freak it, we are vampires and inhumane. If it is contradictory that Noddism tell us that obeying elders is rightful while we follow Caine's teachings as a hunter-king (not as a lawful-king), than frick it, we will chow down and refuse that specific Noddism and make it our own.<br /> Sabbat is about pride, supremacy and urges.<br /> Camarilla is about control, pacience and submission. <br /> <br /> Both deal with the contradictions of humanity-vampirism and the natural hypocrisies of unlife in their own terms. One subsides, another rips it apart. <br /> I think a Bloody Book of Nod of the Sabbat and a Clean-Cut Obey Book of Nod for the Camarilla would be in order. XD<br /> But unfortunately we will never get that officially.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Strange... When coincidence seems too convenient, I prefer to call it fate.</i><br /> <br /> <b><sup>-Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain</sup> </b>d=","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25534-banu_saulot","name":"Banu_Saulot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25534_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-15T16:52:51-08:00","id":1545974,"title":"","content":"Depending on how far you take the Sabbat-as-religious-extremists thread, something I experienced in the military might shed some light on the &quot;accuracy&quot; of holy books.<br /> <br /> We had detained some al-Qai'da in Iraq (the proto-ISIS) dudes and when we were talking to them, they discussed the copies of the Qur'an that were shipped up from AQ-affiliated extremists in Saudi Arabia. In those copies, there were discussions about how the United States and Israel are evil and must be destroyed. These weren't books <i>interpreting</i> the Qur'an, they were given out <b>as</b> Qur'ans, the unexpurgated lore passed on from God to Muhammad, never to be translated as that would dilute the message. A message that somehow predicted the United States a thousand years ahead of time. It just goes to show how hypocritical religious extremists can be when they need to manipulate their audience.<br /> <br /> I could totally see Sabbat Cardinals pushing modified Books of Nod that say what they think Cainites want to hear in order to achieve a desired result.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":3},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6423-higgipedia","name":"higgipedia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6423_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-17T22:16:17-08:00","id":1546061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>higgipedia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1420445-why-do-sabbat-support-the-book-of-nod?p=1545974#post1545974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depending on how far you take the Sabbat-as-religious-extremists thread, something I experienced in the military might shed some light on the &quot;accuracy&quot; of holy books.<br /> <br /> We had detained some al-Qai'da in Iraq (the proto-ISIS) dudes and when we were talking to them, they discussed the copies of the Qur'an that were shipped up from AQ-affiliated extremists in Saudi Arabia. In those copies, there were discussions about how the United States and Israel are evil and must be destroyed. These weren't books <i>interpreting</i> the Qur'an, they were given out <b>as</b> Qur'ans, the unexpurgated lore passed on from God to Muhammad, never to be tr